    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_01",
      "hash64": "D4DE27C737F6116E",
      "text": "Willkommen auf dem Maskenfest! Heute ist nur\\nder erste Tag, es läuft noch etwas länger...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_01",
      "hash64": "05DBA39DE4B51C34",
      "text": "In Paldea habt ihr bestimmt keine so großen\\nFeste, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_select_01",
      "hash64": "B3C352491FE42AFC",
      "text": "Stimmt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_select_02",
      "hash64": "B3C355491FE43015",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_02",
      "hash64": "05DBA69DE4B5214D",
      "text": "Hehe, wusst ich’s doch. Kitakami kann es locker\\nmit euren ach so tollen Großstädten aufnehmen![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_03",
      "hash64": "05DBA59DE4B51F9A",
      "text": "Na hoppla! Bist du etwa so beeindruckt, dass dir\\ngleich die Worte fehlen?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_02",
      "hash64": "D4DE26C737F60FBB",
      "text": "Nimm’s nicht persönlich, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_11",
      "hash64": "05D81F9DE4B20611",
      "text": "Und weil ich so nett bin, schieß ich für uns ein\\nErinnerungsfoto. Gib mal deinen Rotom-Stick her.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_13",
      "hash64": "05D81D9DE4B202AB",
      "text": "Rückt mal ein bisschen mehr ran, ihr beiden![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_07",
      "hash64": "D4DE29C737F614D4",
      "text": "Autsch! Du stehst auf meinem Fuß, Hana![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_14",
      "hash64": "05D8229DE4B20B2A",
      "text": "Ach, stell dich nicht so an! Das wirst du ja mal\\nkurz aushalten können.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_15",
      "hash64": "05D8239DE4B20CDD",
      "text": "Okay, alle bereit? Sagt „Piepi“![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_12",
      "hash64": "05D81C9DE4B200F8",
      "text": "Da kommt ja richtig Feststimmung auf![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_04",
      "hash64": "05DBA09DE4B5171B",
      "text": "Das Maskenfest feiern wir zu Ehren unserer\\ntapferen Helden: der [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]drei Gefährten[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_05",
      "hash64": "05DB9F9DE4B51568",
      "text": "Diese drei Pokémon haben Kitakami vor langer\\nZeit vor einem Ungeheuer beschützt – dem Oni.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_06",
      "hash64": "05DBA29DE4B51A81",
      "text": "Deswegen ist das Maskendesign der meisten\\nDorfkinder auch von den Gesichtern der\\r\\ndrei Gefährten inspiriert.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_03",
      "hash64": "D4DE25C737F60E08",
      "text": "Hehehe...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_07",
      "hash64": "05DBA19DE4B518CE",
      "text": "Hä? Was kicherst du so blöd?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_04",
      "hash64": "D4DE2CC737F619ED",
      "text": "Ach, n-nichts! Ich hab mir nur gedacht, dass du\\ngar nichts über den Oni weißt...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_08",
      "hash64": "05DB9C9DE4B5104F",
      "text": "Wie bitte?! Ich hab ja wohl mehr Ahnung von den\\nLegenden Kitakamis als du!\\c\\nWas fällt dir eigentlich ein?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_05",
      "hash64": "D4DE2BC737F6183A",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_09",
      "hash64": "05DB9B9DE4B50E9C",
      "text": "Aber ist ja klar, dass ein Baby wie er eher von\\nden Bösewichten beeindruckt ist. Er mag den Oni\\r\\nsogar mehr als die drei Gefährten, pfff![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_brother_06",
      "hash64": "D4DE2AC737F61687",
      "text": "Oh, schaut mal! An dem Stand da gibt’s kandierte\\nÄpfel! Kommt, wir holen uns welche![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_sister_10",
      "hash64": "05D81E9DE4B2045E",
      "text": "Immer dasselbe... Wenn’s Jo zu ungemütlich wird,\\nhaut er ab.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0130_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "8222A1CFE315FEED",
      "text": "Schau dir erst mal in Ruhe das Maskenfest an!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
